1. TRIGGER ORCHESTRATOR
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════

services/conversion/triggerOrchestrator.ts:

A) Trigger event types:
   type TriggerEvent =
     | { type: 'quota_exhausted', quota: 'search' | 'slot' | 'refine' }
     | { type: 'watchlist_full' }
     | { type: 'streak_milestone', days: number }
     | { type: 'game_perfect_streak', count: number }
     | { type: 'mood_history_tap' }
     | { type: 'streaming_link_tap', film_id: number }
     | { type: 'custom_list_attempt' }
     | { type: 'share_card_generated', count: number }

B) Orchestrator class:
   class ConversionTriggerOrchestrator {
     private cooldowns: Map<TriggerType, Date>
     private dismissalCounts: Map<TriggerType, number>
     
     async shouldShowPaywall(event: TriggerEvent): Promise<PaywallVariant | null>
     async recordPaywallShown(variant: PaywallVariant): Promise<void>
     async recordConversion(variant: PaywallVariant): Promise<void>
     async recordDismissal(variant: PaywallVariant): Promise<void>
   }

C) Rules engine:
   - Same trigger 24 saat içinde max 1 kez göster
   - 3 dismiss sonrası 7 gün cooldown
   - Yeni user ilk 24 saat NO PAYWALL (habit formation)
   - Active trial sırasında NO PAYWALL

D) Backend tracking:
   CREATE TABLE paywall_events (
     id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
     user_id UUID REFERENCES users(id),
     variant TEXT NOT NULL,
     trigger_type TEXT NOT NULL,
     trigger_context JSONB,
     action TEXT NOT NULL, -- 'shown' | 'dismissed' | 'converted' | 'trial_started'
     ab_test_group TEXT,
     created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW()
   );

